  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GSMA(Groupe Speciale Mobile Association)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through an accountable grant with GSMA, test and prepare to scale new business models for providing farmers will relevant mobile-based and highly tailored climate and agronomy information and financial services and leveraging mobile technologies to unlock digital identify services for farmers. This will be achieved through (1) partnerships with mobile network operators (MNOs), mobile money providers and agribusinesses to experiment with digital tools and business models in reaching different agricultural segments; (2) generating evidence on best practices in emerging, high-priority areas for DFID, including climate smart agriculture and disability inclusion; and (3) building global partnerships by bringing together private sector players (MNOs, technology providers, agribusinesses) and public actors interested in digitising agricultural value chains, e.g. through round table discussions at GSMA&#x2019;s Mobile 360 events,  and the annual GSMA Mobile World Congress.</narrative>
  </description>
